# 统一 LF：shell / yaml / lua / config / patch 里混进 CRLF 会直接弄坏
# CI 脚本、内核配置合并和 git apply（旧仓库踩过 kmod-chelsio kernel-config CRLF 的坑）
* text=auto
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.lua  text eol=lf
*.c    text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
package/*/kernel-config text eol=lf
*.img binary
*.gz  binary
